Component: metis
Description: METIS 5.1.0, only the objects reachable from the entry points
 MUMPS uses (METIS_NodeND, METIS_PartGraphKway, METIS_SetDefaultOptions and
 their Fortran aliases).
Files: LICENSE.txt, include/metis.h, GKlib/*.h, libmetis/*.h,
 GKlib/error.c, GKlib/mcore.c, GKlib/memory.c, GKlib/random.c,
 GKlib/timers.c, GKlib/util.c,
 libmetis/*.c
Exclude: libmetis/checkgraph.c, libmetis/parmetis.c, libmetis/stat.c
Defines.C:
Notes: patch 0001 makes gk_errexit()/errexit() longjmp back into the METIS API
 function that is running (which then returns METIS_ERROR) instead of
 printing and raising a signal, and stops gk_sigtrap() from installing
 signal handlers.
